# HY300 (2023 firmware) -- the MagCubic HY300 of issue #8 (GitHub `erfrizzera`, 02.-05.11.2026): the classic HY300
# case, a 720p panel (0x34), the oldest ADT-3 firmware seen (U-Boot and ARISC of 2023-06-25), a display.bin revision of
# its own, the HY350 family's DRAM block at 792 MHz. Not the HY300 Pro (636 MHz, 2024-12 firmware). Silkscreen unknown:
# the owner cannot open the unit. Nobody here has the board; nothing of ours has run on it. Described from the owner's
# identify, his h713-extract report over his partition files and his read of the raw eMMC head.
BOARD_ID=hy300-2023
STATUS=profile-only
VERIFIED_BY=
PROFILE=hy300_2023
IMAGE_NAME=h713-hy300-2023
# kernel patch 0350: the HY300 Pro's tree with the focus motor off (the case has a manual focus ring, no motor; no
# camera; a headphone jack). The display firmware is a revision nobody has run: its elog addresses and AFBD handoff
# words are unknown, the tree keeps the HY300 Pro's. Built with dtc, never booted.
KERNEL_DTB=sun50i-h713-hy300-2023
# U-Boot base hy300_2023_defconfig (fork branch, 05.11.2026): hy300_pro_defconfig with the HY350 family's DRAM block at
# 792 MHz (his boot0), this tree and its identification string. Our HY300 Pro U-Boot at 636 MHz trained his DRAM for UMS
# (his read, 04.11.2026). uboot.config beside this file keeps the same block for a probe build.
UBOOT_BOARD=hy300_2023
# Optional hardware: nothing measured. The owner: no focus motor, no camera, a headphone jack, one button, a remote.
FEATURES=
# the name in the network (TODO 5.18)
HOSTNAME_BOARD=hy300
